#!/usr/bin/env bash

if [[ $1 == "silence" ]]; then
    cat <<EOF

The ancient door rumbles open...

You spoke the word hidden in the shadows,
and the mirrors shatter into harmless dust.

The hall of mirrors was an illusion all along.
Only those who look beneath the surface
can see through deception.

Beyond the shattered glass, a cellar is revealed.

EOF
    mv .cellar cellar 2>/dev/null
    exit 0
fi

cat <<EOF

The door remains sealed.

You hear a faint whisper echoing
through the mirrors:

   "Only those who look beneath
    the surface may pass..."

Hint: Investigate what others overlook.
      « ls -a » to find hidden things,
      then « cat » what you discover.

EOF
